# Best Synergy Pilots (BSP) rebuild scope

From **v16 onward**, when changing BSP formula / criteria / DC rules:

- Rebuild only **top 250** units (by sort damage) **plus newly added / uncached** units.
- Keep long-tail cached rankings from the previous version; users rarely open those units.
- Use: `python scripts/build_msy_rankings_dc.py --incremental --workers 2 --checkpoint 50`
- Optional: `--top-n N` or env `BSP_INCREMENTAL_TOP_N` (default 250).
- Full-catalog rebuild is opt-in only (omit `--incremental`, or `--force` without incremental).

Do not kick off a full ~1300-unit DC rebuild for routine formula tweaks.
